    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: mainCharacterIsSpeaking
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.sentences.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: <SFX_liezel_wondering>Yes, I believe that would be more efficient. These
        will definitely lead us to where we need to be. Let me know if you need assistance
        with the fragment. Else, follow your instincts.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: "If what you\u2019re saying about this fragment is true, we should be
        able to find something that no one else knows about, hopefully."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: <i>(Although, there were peculiar symbols that Ate Lorena must have
        written. Now that I think about it, those two ideas do not connect at all.
        Could those actually mean something in terms that only they know about?)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: <i>(Although, there were peculiar symbols that Ate Lorena must have
        written. Now that I think about it, those two ideas do not connect at all.
        Could those actually mean something in terms that only they know about?)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: objectsToActivateAfter.Array.size
      value: 0
