    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - "Indeed, it is but one of many of salakab\u2019s uses. It is also often used
      in rituals or as a magical material..."
    - "Ah, but that is besides the point. What I am trying to say is that it may
      be able to solve your town\u2019s current predicament."
    - ... If you can convince your people to make use of it.
    - <SFX_liezel_concerned>However, you should not be too eager with its use. Its
      effects have not yet been fully researched and... hmm.
