    textPunctSpeed: 0.18
    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - <i>(There is only one outpost like that around Sumpagita. I suppose it is to
      be expected that my book remained in this area. )</i>
    - "<i>(I should head <b><u>west</u></b>. The Disidensiya\u2019s <b>Sumpagita
      Outpost</b> is over there, <b>just past the forest</b>.)</i>"
